  <4>qed. QED BY ONLY <3>squar, <4>oldX, <4>oldPair, SMTT(5) DEF DQ_Q
 <3>qed. QED BY ONLY <2>on, <3>each, SMTT(5) DEF EntryQuarantineDisjoint
